<p>Arbayeen hai arbaayeen hai<br />
Ro rahi hai karbala me syeda, arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>

<p>Gham me doob jaaiye hussain ka.. arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>

<p>1. Chutke qaid se jab aayi karbala me bibiya<br />
Bekasi pe shah ki tab ro raha tha aasman<br />
Keh rahe the sogwaar e karbala arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>

<p>2. Qabr par hussain ke hai aasmaan ke makeen<br />
Maatam e hussain mein hai aaj zainab e hazeen<br />
Sar ko apne peet te hai mustafa arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>

<p>3. God khaali dekhti hai aaj saari bibiyan..<br />
Karbala ki khaak me hai aaj haashmi jawaan<br />
Fateha ke waste koi na tha arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>

<p>4. Zakhmi hai gala ye mera dukh rahe hai ustoqa<br />
Qaid hoke ranj sehke sar mai laaya baaba jaan<br />
Lijiye salaam apne laal ka arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>

<p>5. Kaise sham hum gaye the bhai jaan na puchiye<br />
Zulm ke nishaan mere baazuo pe dekhiye<br />
Karne zainab aayi hai maatam tera arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>

<p>6. Ro rahe hai murtaza bhi qabr par hussain ki<br />
Ro rahe hai mujtaba bhi qabr par hussain ki<br />
Bhooki pyaasi shah ki sipaah ka arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>

<p>7. Ghamzada rasool ki nawaasiyo ki deed thi<br />
Hum jo pohanche berida to shaamiyo me eid thi<br />
Ghazi teri yaad aayi us jagah arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>

<p>8. Jaane kab hayaat humse moo ko apne modhle<br />
Matam e hussain karke rab se naata jodhle<br />
<b>Dawar</b> e hazeen ki hai ye ilteja arbayeen hai arbayeen hai</p>


